OL,3,GNEWSAFuture of A5 upgrade being heard
OL,4,Aat Court of Appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA decision on the future of the
OL,7,Flong-delayed A5 upgrade project will be
OL,8,Fmade in the Court of Appeal on Tuesday.
OL,10,FProposals to build a new dual dual
OL,11,Fcarriageway between Londonderry and
OL,12,FAughnacloy go back almost 20 years but
OL,13,Fhave been beset by funding and legal
OL,14,Fissues.
OL,16,FLast year, a court ruled the Department
OL,17,Ffor Infrastructure's (DfI) plans for
OL,18,Fthe road did not comply with climate
OL,19,Ftargets. It was the third time in 18
OL,20,Fyears that approval for the road has
OL,21,Fbeen overturned in court.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
